! _24EDO_full.scl
! Cent values after Sami Abu Shumays' maqam presets for Ableton Live 12 (tuning.ableton.com/arabic-maqam). Egypt/Greater Syria practice; one practitioner's deeply-informed version, NOT a universal standard. Maqam identity is melodic, not just the scale.
24-EDO: 24 equal quarter-tones per octave (the shared maqam grid)
